#: client/components/Mentions.vue:505
msgctxt "mentions.missingQueryOn"
msgid "No conversation with {target} on {network} open: open one to read these, or dismiss them."
msgstr "没有打开与 {network} 上 {target} 的对话：打开对话即可阅读，或将其移除。"

