#. Oper tools, alert builder: the count line under the form, how many users on the network the alert's criteria match right now (from O3's trace). Shown past 25 matches, in amber: {matches} is the count line so far. A warning that the alert may catch too many people. Keep IRC/oper jargon as is (G-line, shun, Z-line, K-line, oper, X3, O3, AuthServ, ChanServ) and every {placeholder} verbatim.
